                                                "sense_id": "44f2bee6-5fcc-376d-bc1f-b45138c9e754",
                                                "text": "Aldrichimica Acta Volume 30 No 4 (pdf) from Sigma-Aldrich\nUsing adamantylidenylfulvene, a similar adduct, was obtained where the adamantyl group is positioned rigidly onto the molecular framework by virtue of the olefinic linkage originating from the fulvene."
